#: ../../funding/putuo-seed.rst:1
msgid "Putuo Technology Enterprise Seed Plan, second 2026 batch"
msgstr "2026普陀科创企业种子计划第二批"

#: ../../funding/putuo-seed.rst:4
msgid "Grant | Putuo"
msgstr "补助｜普陀区"

#: ../../funding/putuo-seed.rst:6
msgid "Closed"
msgstr "已截止"

#: ../../funding/putuo-seed.rst:8

#| msgid ""
#| "`Evidence S117 "
#| "<https://www.shpt.gov.cn/zhengwu/tzgg-kwzdgz/2026/212/204863.html>`_. "
#| "关于开展2026年度普陀区科创企业“种子计划”（第二批）申报工作的通知-上海普陀."
msgid ""
"`Evidence S120 "
"<https://www.shpt.gov.cn/zhengwu/tzgg-kwzdgz/2026/212/204863.html>`_. "
"关于开展2026年度普陀区科创企业“种子计划”（第二批）申报工作的通知-上海普陀."
msgstr "`证据 S120 <https://www.shpt.gov.cn/zhengwu/tzgg-kwzdgz/2026/212/204863.html>`_. 关于开展2026年度普陀区科创企业“种子计划”（第二批）申报工作的通知-上海普陀."

#: ../../funding/putuo-seed.rst:10
msgid "Amount and mechanism"
msgstr "额度与机制"

#: ../../funding/putuo-seed.rst:13
msgid ""
"RMB 300,000 per selected company; 50% initially, remainder after one-year "
"development review"
msgstr "获选企业30万元，首期50%，一年后按发展情况拨付余款"

#: ../../funding/putuo-seed.rst:15
msgid "No equity"
msgstr "不占股"

#: ../../funding/putuo-seed.rst:17
msgid "Eligibility and timing"
msgstr "资格与时间"

#: ../../funding/putuo-seed.rst:20
msgid ""
"Lawfully established technology companies with good credit. Online "
"application is accompanied by stamped paper materials through the "
"responsible investment promotion center; the science commission evaluates "
"the project."
msgstr "依法设立且信用良好的科创企业，线上申报并向对应投促中心提交盖章纸质材料，由区科委组织评估。"

#: ../../funding/putuo-seed.rst:22
msgid "Closed 31 August 2026"
msgstr "已于2026年8月31日截止"

#: ../../funding/putuo-seed.rst:24
msgid "Contact and application"
msgstr "联系与申请"

#: ../../funding/putuo-seed.rst:27
msgid ""
"`Official application / policy route "
"<https://kwxxh.shpt.gov.cn/v2/ptoa/#/user/register>`_"
msgstr "`官方申请／政策入口 <https://kwxxh.shpt.gov.cn/v2/ptoa/#/user/register>`_"

#: ../../funding/putuo-seed.rst:29
msgid "Published consultation: +86 21 52564588 ext. 8627."
msgstr "公布咨询电话：+86 21 52564588 ext. 8627。"

#: ../../funding/putuo-seed.rst:31
msgid ""
"Editorial application checklist. The current official notice or agreement "
"controls the actual procedure."
msgstr "编辑申请清单，实际流程以现行官方通知或协议为准。"

#: ../../funding/putuo-seed.rst:33
msgid ""
"Read the dated call and verify district, entity, activity and "
"spending-period rules."
msgstr "阅读带日期通知，核验属地、主体、业务及支出期间。"

#: ../../funding/putuo-seed.rst:35
msgid ""
"Prepare the prescribed pack and complete host or district endorsement if "
"required."
msgstr "准备规定材料，按要求完成单位或区级推荐。"

#: ../../funding/putuo-seed.rst:37
msgid ""
"Submit through the official platform before the stated deadline and keep "
"the receipt."
msgstr "在截止前通过官方平台提交并保存回执。"

#: ../../funding/putuo-seed.rst:39
msgid ""
"Follow review, award, reporting, acceptance and payment obligations in "
"the notice."
msgstr "遵循通知中的评审、立项、报告、验收及拨付义务。"

#: ../../funding/putuo-seed.rst:41
msgid ""
"The published maximum is a ceiling, not an entitlement. Check the "
"applicable notice, eligible cost period, other public support and written "
"payment conditions."
msgstr "公布最高额为上限，不构成当然权益。须核验适用通知、合资格支出期间、其他财政资助及书面拨付条件。"
